I MASAHARU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAMEI MASATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI TADAYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HAYASHI, MASAHARU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAMEI, MASATOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, TADAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Aqueous artificial media comprising a water-absorbing polymer and being appropriate as media for soil culture and water culture of plants. Namely, an aqueous artificial medium and a polymer composition containing from 0.01 to 10 % by weight of a water-absorbing polymer and from 0.001 to 10 % by weight of a cationic polymer; and an aqueous artificial medium and a polymer composition further containing a porous water-supplying support provided with open cells.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des milieux artificiels aqueux comprenant un polymère absorbant l'eau et étant particulièrement adaptés comme milieux pour la culture des plantes dans la terre et dans l'eau. L'invention traite plus particulièrement d'un milieu artificiel aqueux et d'une composition de polymères contenant entre 0,01 et 10 % en poids d'un polymère absorbant l'eau et entre 0,001 et 10 % en poids d'un polymère cationique. L'invention a aussi pour objet un milieu artificiel aqueux et une composition de polymères contenant, entre autres, un support poreux fournissant de l'eau pourvu d'alvéoles ouverts.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>